|type=Building block
|foot=1
}}

== Usage ==
Purpur blocks are primarily decorative [[block]]s, similar to other [[bricks|brick]]-type blocks. They can also be used to craft different variants of the block. 

=== Crafting ingredient ===
{{crafting usage|Purpur Block}}

=== Stonecutting ingredient ===
{{Stonecutting
|showname=1
|Purpur Block
|Purpur Slab, 2;Purpur Stairs;Purpur Pillar
}}

=== Note blocks ===
Purpur blocks can be placed under [[note block]]s to produce "bass drum" sounds.

=== Sulfur cube ===
{{In development|section=1|drop=Chaos Cubed}}
[[Sulfur cube]]s have the ability to absorb purpur blocks, either through picking them up or being interacted with them. This provides the regular/football effect to the mob when hitting it.

